{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c8aee598ae583927","name":"Remote Starship Starter","source":{"id":"source:reference-c8aee598ae583927","title":"Remote Starship Starter","revision":21094,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:09:11Z","sha256":"9e2b566abd6cf81d8390b14ed0304aae50374b4cd243b5a02d8d129bf6bc20b3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21094","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Remote%20Starship%20Starter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c8aee598ae583927","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 50\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Scoundrels have a habit of fleeing starports with the authorities on their heels. When a captain cannot leave a crew member back at the ship, a Remote Starship Starter comes in handy. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," equipped with this radio transmitter can signal the ship to begin the preflight processes; the ship transmits preflight diagnostics back to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},". Although the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is not able to operate the ship remotely, having the ship prepared for departure can save the crew vital minutes during an escape.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
